From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kernel <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:05:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: remoteproc: explicitly select ADSP loader binding

The topaz DTB check treated the qcom,adsp-loader child of the simple-bus
as a bus node and required a ranges property, despite the dedicated
binding added in the previous series. Make schema selection explicit
for this compatible so the node is validated by its remoteproc binding,
not by the generic simple-bus fallback.

Signed-off-by: Kernel <noreply@localhost>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,adsp-loader.yaml | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,adsp-loader.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,adsp-loader.yaml
index b6e57e1e2..000000000 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,adsp-loader.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/remoteproc/qcom,adsp-loader.yaml
@@ -2,7 +2,14 @@
 %YAML 1.2
 ---
 $id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/remoteproc/qcom,adsp-loader.yaml#
 $schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+select:
+  properties:
+    compatible:
+      const: qcom,adsp-loader
+  required:
+    - compatible
 
 title: Qualcomm ADSP loader
 
-- 
2.39.5
